      "created_at": "2016-10-05T17:21:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>First off, I want to be clear that I understand that getting the Vengeance format up and running in a useful, easy to grok way could be daunting, and I know that having The Sentinels in the same expansion probably doesn't help. &nbsp;That said, I was just curious if y'all at Handelabra had a ballpark for Vengeance hitting. &nbsp;Are we talking like Christmas? &nbsp;Winter 2017? Spring? Summer?</p><p>I'm mostly curious from the heroes side, as I've been playing a lot of Parse and KNYFE in the tabletop version lately, and I look forward to playing them in the video game.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:14.689Z",
